      "rule": "The host values in launch/hosts/SETUP_VALUES.json, as proposed from the node's tested harnesses: unit limits per host (memory 6 GiB so 8 GB hosts suffice, 4,096 tasks, 65,536 open files); ports (P2P 26656, endpoint client channel 26670, endpoint status page 8080); root-owned code only; the catalog, process observation and root helper bounds; the root configuration's sizes and 30-second timeout; and the emergency verifier's 30-second timeout. The staging hosts re-check the memory cap and the timeouts before genesis."
    }
